  m_text: "                CLAIMING KING\n\n\nAfter selected a piece, you may\nclaim
    that the piece is a King\n\nOnce you clicked the button,\npossible King moves
    appear and\nyou may play as King\n\nPay attention, if you really played a King
    and opponent claims BLUFF, you win the set immediately.\n\nSo, the game ends
    after a King is revealed. \n"
